.env
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
_test_*
# output/*.html WAS gitignored under the old "GitHub Actions runs the whole
# pipeline" plan (CI would generate them fresh at runtime). That plan doesn't
# work - stats.nba.com blocks requests from cloud IPs - so the pipeline runs
# at home and pushes its output/*.html here instead; the "Deploy Brief to
# Pages" workflow just republishes whatever's in output/ on every push. So
# output/*.html (including index.html) IS tracked now, same as output/assets/
# and output/manifest.json.
